  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture m.ll 'call void %fp(ptr @g)' in @ind yields calls ind -> llvm_ir:m.ll:1-1:g:variable. _get_call_target (llvm_ir.py:119) still returns the first global_var from iter_tree(call_node); ac651f01d5 changed only caller-by-position. MECHANISM: callee taken as the first global_var anywhere in the call instruction instead of the callee operand. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-dibiv,WI-jalal."  # 814c
